  "street_name": "Drury Lane",
  "decision_date": "16/09/2025",
  "date_building_work_completed_under_previous_permission": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed infills and projecting bays, by reason of their design, form, and fenestration materiality, would be detrimental to the character and appearance of the existing building. The design and form of the works would result in an incoherent and unordered building, failing to contribute positively to the Seven Dials Conservation Area. The proposal is therefore contrary to policies D1 (Design) D2 (Heritage) of Camden Local Plan 2017.\r\n\r\n",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed development, in the absence of additional on-site cycle parking to complement the increased office floor space, would fail to promote more sustainable and efficient forms of transport and active lifestyles, contrary to Policies T1 (Prioritising walking, cycling and public transport) and DM1 (Delivery and monitoring) of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017. \r\n",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposed development, in the absence of a legal agreement securing an Construction Management Plan Contribution and Impact Bond and , would fail to protect existing and proposed transport infrastructure, contrary to policy T3 (Transport infrastructure) of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017. \r\n"
  ],
